4. No warranty
--------------------------------------------------------------------
Reaper is provided AS-IS, WITHOUT ANY WARRANTY, to the extent
permitted by applicable law — see the "NO WARRANTY" sections of GPL
v2 in `LICENSE`. It is a community hardening effort with no
guarantee. Flashing firmware carries risk; keep a recovery path
ready and use it at your own risk. The maintainer is not liable for
any damage, data loss, or bricked hardware arising from its use.


5. Security-fix disclosure
--------------------------------------------------------------------
Security issues are reported and handled per `SECURITY.md`. Because
much of the hardened userspace is shared with stock ASUS/Merlin
firmware across models, please practice coordinated disclosure for
any base-firmware finding so the upstream vendors can respond.
